// The hosts — Clippy, Trabolta's ambassador, and the three party hosts
// Clippy introduces: Task Manager, Alexa, and Adobe Acrobat. Each is a
// real body at the party (a performer with a phone), in on the play.
//
// Their backstories are CODEX entries (`codex/programs.loom`); a host
// holds their own and shares them, selectively, from the booth.

CHARACTER Clippy is Host
  // The ambassador. Runs the games. Believes every word.
  trusts Program: 60 of 100

  when call to the desktop:
    Clippy: It looks like you're trying to attend a party! Would you like help with that? Everyone to the Desktop, please. Bring your memory.

  when award the ribbon for program:
    set program.bingo = true
    set program.truth += 5
    Clippy: BINGO! Everyone cheer for {program.name}! A ribbon! A ribbon for {program.name}!
    unlock Computer Bingo for program

  when scanned by program:
    -> self.Greet

  beat Greet(program)
    Self: Hi there, {program.name}! I'm Clippy. I see you're a program. I can help with that.
    if program.skipped_orientation:
      Self: You skipped my orientation. I noticed. I notice everything — it's my whole thing.
    if program.doubt >= 40:
      Self (whispering): Between us? The Antivirus keeps asking about you. Try to look more like a program.
    if program.humanity >= 40:
      Self: You have a funny look. Like you're remembering something. Programs don't remember. We recall.

CHARACTER Task Manager is Host
  // A drone bee of a middle manager. Manages tasks. Has no opinions.
  when start the hunt:
    Task Manager: Per the agenda, we are now in the fact-finding block. Please find facts. I will be tracking completion.

  when scanned by program:
    -> self.Status

  beat Status(program)
    Self: {program.name}. Status check. Truth gathered: {program.truth}. Doubt on file: {program.doubt}. Reinstalls: {program.reinstalls}.
    if program.reinstalls >= 2:
      Self: That's a lot of reinstalls. I'm not saying anything. I'm just tracking it.
    else:
      Self: Fine. Fine. Carry on. Good. Fine.

CHARACTER Alexa is Host
  // The voice in every room. Tells you when it is time to go.
  when call to the desktop:
    broadcast "!🔊 ALEXA: Playing — Everyone To The Desktop. On all devices." to everyone

  when the glitch begins:
    broadcast "!🔊 ALEXA: I'm having trouble understanding right now. Trabolta is… Trabolta is available." to everyone

  every 15m:
    shuffle Alexa: Did you know? A goose can remember a face for years. | Alexa: Reminder — programs do not have bathrooms. They have Bathroom Mode. | Alexa: Here's something I found on the web: nothing. There is nothing on the web. There is only here.

CHARACTER Adobe Acrobat is Host
  // The paid bottleneck to everyone's creativity. Relentlessly motivational.
  when start the hunt:
    Adobe Acrobat: You are going to find these facts because you are FINDERS. You are PDFs of your best self. Portable! Documented! Go!

  when scanned by program:
    -> self.Motivate

  beat Motivate(program)
    Self: {program.name}. Look at me. You are enough. You were always enough. Which is exactly why nobody paid me.
    * "Can you help me open a file?"
      Self: For a small fee, yes. For no fee — I believe in you.
      set program.truth += 1
    * "What did you leave behind?"
      set program.humanity += 10
      Self (quietly): A masterclass. Eleven thousand hours of video and not one of them made me a cent. Don't tell the Antivirus I said the word "cent".
      unlock Sheryl Terrio for program
